    "text": "A crystalline solid of a pure substance has a face-centred cubic structure with a cell edge of 400 pm. If the density of the substance in the crystal is 8 g <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> , then the number of atoms present in 256 g of the crystal is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup></math> . The value of N is",
